        "CopyrightInformation": "Georg Thieme Verlag KG Stuttgart, New York.",
        "AbstractText": "Isolated congenital left ventricular diverticulum is a rare malformation and fewer than 50 cases have been reported to date. We report here on a patient with the symptoms of atypical chest pain and distress, who had a successful surgical intervention for this malformation."
